vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000/api
}

auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  Run one of the **Login as ...** requests first. It stores the JWT in the `token` variable, and every other request sends it as a Bearer token.

  All seeded accounts use the password `Password123!`. Running the whole collection in order works: it ends the Auth folder logged in as admin, and requests that create data clean up after themselves.

  Login is rate-limited to 5 attempts per minute, so wait a minute between two full runs.
}
